  SPARC: 144 galaxies, 2681 points (Q<3, i>30, eV/V<0.10); file real_research/data/sparc_data/*_rotmod.dat

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  THE REQUIRED Delta(s).  Delta_req(s) = (g_HSE - g_bar)/a0 at s = g_bar/a0, per cluster per radius, binned in s.
  This Delta reproduces the corrected X-COP enclosed-mass profile EXACTLY from the baryons alone, by construction.
