  C9  the SHAPE gate.  Any Delta = s[nu(s)-1] with a deep-MOND limit has d log Delta/d log s -> 1/2 as s -> 0 and
      falling to 0 at its ceiling, so its log-slope never exceeds 1/2.  Measured on the family over the cluster range:
      carrier (exp, completed)     max d log Delta/d log s over s in [0.088, 0.909] = 0.368
      nu_RAR (CARRIED)             max d log Delta/d log s over s in [0.088, 0.909] = 0.422
      simple mu                    max d log Delta/d log s over s in [0.088, 0.909] = 0.427
      standard mu                  max d log Delta/d log s over s in [0.088, 0.909] = 0.327
